 - 2026-06-07: META-EBM CASCADE ROUTER prototype (classifier-first cascade, disk-reads exp3917, no hard gate): the cheap energy verifier scores EVERY item; only the close-calls (energy-margin within a tuned band) escalate to the LLM-as-judge (reusing exp3917's per-item LLM scores — no re-inference). Report cascade AUROC vs pure-LLM AUROC, the escalation fraction, and the resulting cost vs pure-LLM. The deployable artifact behind 'parity at Nx cheaper' (the Wastefulness Condition is checkable on calibration data alone). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: cascade_router_WINS_gap-0.3896_11512.51x_cheaper_at_matched_accuracy_escfrac0.0000; results/experiment_3918_cascade_router_prototype.json
 - 2026-06-07: ARC-AGI-3 harness SCAFFOLD — BUILD + UNIT-TEST the verifier-first skeleton (north-star §5 agentic-proof venue, sequenced AFTER the offline proof; infra-only, no science): implement an environment-adapter interface (reset/step/observe) over a tiny synthetic ARC-AGI-3-style grid task + a verifier-as-router stub (run the cheap encodable specialist, verify via the energy verifier, escalate on failure — the Meta-EBM Cascade Router action-pruner shape). SHIP a unit test asserting the env steps, the router routes by verifier score, and an action-pruning count is recorded. Deliverable = the module + a PASSING test. NO benchmark/agentic-performance claim. GPU-free. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_agi3_scaffold_READY_pruned8_synthetic_only_agentic_proof_can_follow_offline_proof; results/experiment_3919_arc_agi3_harness_scaffold.json
 - 2026-06-07: FACTS graph-grounding verifier — LAST DISCIPLINED retry (PRD Tier C, deprioritized): repair the HalluGraph-style (arXiv:2512.01659) Entity-Grounding + Relation-Preservation -> Composite Fidelity Index verifier so it ACTUALLY invokes the model per item via the exp3915 robust gguf_inference harness, and SHIP a unit test on a NON-separable fixture (subtle hallucinated relations -> fixture AUROC in [0.6,0.95], NOT 1.0) asserting model_invoked + token counts logged. LAST attempt before the facts route retires to honest future-work. Deliverable = the module + a PASSING test. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_llama_cpp_inference_failed; results/experiment_3920_facts_graph_grounding_last_retry.json
+- 2026-06-07: FR-11 continuous self-learning v25 (research-program.md MANDATE) — load the persisted v24 independence-reweighting state (exp3888), continue Tier-1 ONLINE reweighting on a FRESH verification-corpus slice (upweight verifiers that catch the residual others miss, arXiv:2604.07650), and confirm the learned weighting STILL holds the +0.0185 memory-ablation contribution + frozen 0.9131 across the v24->v25 iteration (no long-horizon overfit). CPU counter updates (<1us/update, the Tier-1 hardware path). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fr11_v25_INVARIANT_HELD_auroc0.9078_memcontrib0.0185_state_persisted; results/experiment_3921_fr11_v25_independence_reweighting.json
